Enumeration DisciplineActionLengthDifferenceReason
    documentation 'Indicates the reason for the difference, if any, between the official and actual 
    'lengths of a student's disciplinary assignment.
    item No Difference
    item Term Modified By District
    item Term Modified By Court Order
    item Term Modified By Mutual Agreement
    item Student Completed Term Requirements Sooner Than Expected
    item Student Incarcerated
    item Term Decreased Due To Extenuating Health-Related Circumstances
    item Student Withdrew From School
    item School Year Ended
    item Continuation Of Previous Year's Disciplinary Action Assignment
    item Term Modified By Placement Program Due To Student Behavior While In The Placement
    item Other

